**Branch with the commit**: [ggbdpq/magpie `fix/4780-image-chip-verify`](https://github.com/ggbdpq/magpie/tree/fix/4780-image-chip-verify) (head `3ccc1fc1b5b06017b7778925ea1bbd0850e8ebf9` — CaC033's commit, authorship preserved, committer ggbdpq).

